{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 50, :comments ["<b>The sense of ויעשו כל בני ישראל,</b> He has already mentioned this above. Perhaps this refers to the Passover observed in the wilderness of Sinai, when the converts were circumcised. Do not wonder that it is written in this place, for in the section of the manna's descent it is written that one should take a jar and place manna there and set it before the Testimony, and HaShem had not yet commanded to make the Ark of the Testimony. Similarly, הוצאתי את צבאותיכם (above, chapter 17)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:00.218442225Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}